Subject: [PATCH] fix(tui): backport complete fullscreen mouse validity
 correction

Apply the complete a2984f67..469d0e72 correction to Pi 1.4.0 as one commit, including safe capture transfers and explicit internal validity provenance. Preserve pinned public APIs and MainScreenMouse policy.

Upstream commits: 725b04f7735c9888284958ea06395ac7e6d39467 and 469d0e72ee5aa17d5b1fd109764e6240b3933d88. The initial correction is not integrated independently.
